XU=c("Learning to Segment Under Various Forms of Weak Supervision (CVPR 2015)","https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_cvpr_2015/html/Xu_Learning_to_Segment_2015_CVPR_paper.html","combines several weak supervision types for segmentation")
SIZE=c("Constrained-CNN losses for weakly supervised segmentation (Kervadec et al., arXiv 1805.04628)","https://www.arxiv.org/pdf/1805.04628","introduces size-constraint losses for segmentation from weak labels; the proposed idea applies this technique to MVFA's segmentation branch")
